-- src:5764 | If no belief in validity of custody order or parenting order
-- src:5765 | (2) If a count charges an offence under subsection (1) and the offence is not proven only because the accused did not believe that there was a valid custody order or parenting order but the evidence does prove an offence under section 283, the accused may be convicted of an offence under that section.
